WriterAgent logo (writeragent_logo.svg → logo_24.png, writeragent_32.png)
=========================================================================
Dev tree only — not shipped in the .oxt (see scripts/build_oxt.py should_exclude).

Source: simplified from logo.jpg, the WriterAgent project logo, under the same
terms as logo.jpg.

Deck icon ships as a 24×24 PNG (the macOS size); off macOS, menu_icon_dpi.apply_deck_icons stores writeragent_32.png in the user configuration (see docs/framework/uno-utilities.md).

Regenerate 24×24 PNG (sidebar deck icon):
  rsvg-convert -w 24 -h 24 --background-color=none writeragent_logo.svg -o /tmp/wa24.png
  magick /tmp/wa24.png PNG32:logo_24.png

Regenerate 32×32 PNG (sidebar deck icon off macOS):
  rsvg-convert -w 32 -h 32 --background-color=none writeragent_logo.svg -o /tmp/wa32.png
  magick /tmp/wa32.png PNG32:writeragent_32.png

Regenerate 94×84 PNG (Extension Manager icon, 47:42 aspect ratio for DrawRow):
  rsvg-convert -w 84 -h 84 --background-color=none writeragent_logo.svg -o /tmp/wa84.png
  magick /tmp/wa84.png -background none -gravity center -extent 94x84 PNG32:extension_icon.png
